# ============================================================
# News Radar · .gitignore  (main branch = 純程式碼)
# ------------------------------------------------------------
# 原則：
#   - 秘鑰一律不入庫（用 GitHub Actions Secrets）
#   - runtime 產物（DB、logs、archive）不在 main branch，活在 state branch
#   - OS / IDE / venv 噪音一律擋掉
# ============================================================

# --- 秘鑰 / 本機設定 ---
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
# macOS / OneDrive duplicate（常見型態："xxx 2"）
.env 2
.env.local 2

# --- Python runtime ---
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd
.Python
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# --- venv ---（不加斜線 → 同時擋目錄與 symlink）
.venv
.venv*
venv
venv*
env/

# --- OS / IDE ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo

# --- runtime 產物（這些活在 state branch，不污染 main）---
news_radar.db
news_radar.db-journal
news_radar.db-wal
news_radar.db-shm
# 整個 data/ 都是運行期 / 策略性內容 → 不入 main
# 唯一例外：data/01_harvest/schema.sql（結構定義，要可 code review）
data/*
!data/01_harvest
data/01_harvest/*
!data/01_harvest/schema.sql
logs/
archive/
scratch/
state/last_harvest.txt

# --- 根目錄的 scratch 測試 / 策略檔 ---
test_fb.py
test_parse.py
test_playwright.py
strategic_directives.md

# --- Meta 驗證臨時產物 ---
fb_dom.html
*_dom.html
drafts_for_review.csv

# --- 診斷報告（會被 make diag 重新產生）---
data/01_harvest/diagnostic_report.md
data/01_harvest/feeds_health.md

# --- Playwright / Puppeteer 快取 ---
.playwright/
playwright-report/
test-results/

# --- 其他 ---
*.log
tmp/
.tmp/
AGENT_WORKLOG.md
